scheduleOutBridgeTransfer.t.sol
├── when call is reentrant
│  └── it should revert with ReentrancyGuardReentrantCall
└── when call is not reentrant
   ├── when caller is not the controller contract
   │  └── it should revert with NotController
   └── when caller is the controller contract
      ├── given the relevant bridge config contract is not set in the core registry
      │  └── it should revert with BridgeConfigNotSet
      └── given the relevant bridge config contract is set in the core registry
         ├── when the provided route is invalid
         │  └── it should revert with InvalidBridgeTransferRoute
         └── when the provided route is valid
            ├── given caller has insufficient token allowance
            │  └── it should revert with ERC20InsufficientAllowance
            └── given caller has sufficient token allowance
               ├── given caller has insufficient token balance
               │  └── it should revert with ERC20InsufficientBalance
               └── given caller has sufficient token balance
                  ├── it should increase the adapter's token balance by amount
                  ├── it should decrease the caller's token balance by amount
                  └── it should emit an OutBridgeTransferScheduled event
